WEBVTT

00:00.750 --> 00:05.210
I shall pass on one of those to you as a gift.

00:07.530 --> 00:10.880
That is called the Compass of Eternal Paths.

00:11.670 --> 00:13.800
The concept magic spell it is imbued with...

00:13.800 --> 00:16.790
...can lead you to the place you want.

00:18.330 --> 00:22.500
If you wish for something, the compass will
show you where that something may be found.

00:22.500 --> 00:27.670
Whether that something is
a missing person, a hidden object...

00:28.200 --> 00:29.300
Or even...

00:29.870 --> 00:32.050
...a different world.

00:37.060 --> 00:43.690
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

02:05.980 --> 02:10.990
CHANGING HEART

02:16.200 --> 02:17.120
A different...

02:18.200 --> 02:19.230
...world...

02:24.820 --> 02:27.780
So long as you obtain all the ancient magic,

02:28.090 --> 02:31.010
and possess an unbreakable will,

02:31.470 --> 02:34.010
you will be able to go
wherever your hearts desire.

02:34.860 --> 02:36.990
I pray that you can live freely,

02:36.990 --> 02:39.850
in a world where you may
choose your own future.

02:40.240 --> 02:47.720
May the path you walk
be filled with blessings.

02:56.240 --> 02:56.930
Yue.

02:57.710 --> 02:59.260
Let me ask you this...

02:59.260 --> 03:02.820
If you use evolution magic, can you go
through the world with spatial magic?

03:03.460 --> 03:04.720
I'm sorry.

03:05.120 --> 03:05.950
Well...

03:06.370 --> 03:09.620
Not a problem.
I was just wondering.

03:09.620 --> 03:11.960
Only one more type of ancient magic left.

03:11.960 --> 03:14.240
We just have to obtain it.

03:16.430 --> 03:20.090
Anyway, you don't have to look so sad, Yue.

03:23.920 --> 03:24.690
Yue?

03:30.290 --> 03:32.160
S-Say, Nagumo...

03:33.390 --> 03:34.760
About earlier...

03:36.070 --> 03:39.000
Um, if you can use concept magic...

03:39.390 --> 03:41.610
Yeah, I can go back.

03:41.990 --> 03:45.150
At least the compass would
tell me where I'll end up.

03:46.280 --> 03:47.640
I see...

03:52.030 --> 03:53.810
U-Um...

03:54.090 --> 03:57.590
When you go back, um...

03:57.590 --> 03:58.360
Well...

03:58.360 --> 04:02.210
Fret not. As long as there's no such
disadvantage of limited people to teleport,

04:02.210 --> 04:04.190
I'll just bring you guys along.

04:04.930 --> 04:07.860
Is that so? Thanks, Nagumo.

04:07.860 --> 04:12.520
Anywho, if you're so unsure
in asking that question...

04:12.520 --> 04:14.010
I guess you guys are no good, eh?

04:15.190 --> 04:18.510
Yaegashi, looks like you came in terms
with the labyrinth clearing, huh?

04:18.510 --> 04:21.700
Um... I think I can use it.

04:21.700 --> 04:23.650
Really, Shizuku?

04:23.650 --> 04:25.740
For real? Way to go!

04:25.740 --> 04:28.120
That's my Shizushizu!
Be my wife, please!

04:28.540 --> 04:32.470
At any rate, let's head back to
Verbergen and get some rest.

04:32.470 --> 04:35.720
I still have repercussions
from using Limit Break.

04:36.260 --> 04:38.090
I want Yue to heal me...

04:39.090 --> 04:40.200
Leave it to me.

04:40.200 --> 04:45.690
Mister Hajime, you can always count
on these soft rabbit ears to soothe you!

04:45.690 --> 04:48.170
You can count on me to
heal your fatigue, Hajime!

04:48.170 --> 04:49.240
I'm a priest, you know!

04:49.240 --> 04:53.320
Master! Feel free to use me
as a chair and relax!

04:53.320 --> 04:57.320
Even if my back feels sore,
I will endure it for you!

05:06.870 --> 05:09.670
What's wrong? Come on.

05:10.210 --> 05:11.710
You're gonna heal me, right?

05:29.760 --> 05:32.860
I now understand
why Kaori started to like you.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.890
Yue...

05:36.990 --> 05:39.110
Hey, what's going on?

05:47.480 --> 05:49.770
All right, Sir Nagumo.

05:49.770 --> 05:51.960
Have some of these too.

05:53.600 --> 05:56.840
I can't eat all of these at once...

05:57.270 --> 05:59.170
No need to hold back!

05:59.440 --> 06:01.260
Say ahh, Sir Nagumo!

06:01.590 --> 06:05.890
Hey! Don't cling to him!
You're making him feel awkward!

06:26.430 --> 06:31.220
Isn't Miss Altina the Chief Elder,
Mister Ulfric's granddaughter?

06:31.220 --> 06:35.770
Yeah, Shea said she's
the princess of the forest.

06:35.770 --> 06:36.540
Hmm.

06:36.540 --> 06:41.460
That is quite some bold underwear
despite her innocent look.

06:42.220 --> 06:45.130
Most princesses are just lewd on the inside.

06:45.510 --> 06:46.300
You're right.

06:46.900 --> 06:48.720
Is she okay?

06:49.010 --> 06:51.180
Speaking from her position, that is...

06:52.260 --> 06:54.640
Nah, it's regardless of that...

06:55.300 --> 06:58.050
But look at her face...

06:58.050 --> 06:59.820
Huh? Wh-What?

07:00.120 --> 07:01.730
She seems so happy...

07:01.730 --> 07:04.350
If you try to get closer to him...

07:04.350 --> 07:06.660
You just snapped!

07:06.660 --> 07:10.150
Even my grandfather
has never snapped at me!

07:12.500 --> 07:16.040
What are we witnessing right now?

07:16.040 --> 07:19.420
Tio seems happy since she's found
a comrade in freakery...

07:19.420 --> 07:21.420
But I'd love to think
it's not the case...

07:21.420 --> 07:23.460
Shea, stop it right there.

07:23.460 --> 07:26.380
I already keep getting more and more rivals,

07:26.380 --> 07:29.850
and you expect me to accept
an elven princess as another?!

07:29.850 --> 07:34.400
Also, she seems to be
painfully aware of me!

07:34.400 --> 07:35.500
Hajime.

07:44.030 --> 07:45.360
Hey, Shea.

07:45.770 --> 07:48.280
You say you're having more rivals,

07:48.280 --> 07:49.220
but well...

07:49.650 --> 07:52.560
Do you think of Yue
as your rival, by chance?

07:52.560 --> 07:56.040
Huh? Miss Yue?

07:56.490 --> 07:58.210
I did when we first met,

07:58.520 --> 08:00.930
but I don't think of her as one now.

08:06.070 --> 08:09.890
Then you don't have
to worry about any rivals.

08:10.440 --> 08:11.800
To me,

08:12.630 --> 08:14.370
you are my special.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.790
Mister Hajime...

08:17.790 --> 08:19.360
Also, Shea...

08:19.360 --> 08:24.320
I don't think it's me meddling
with Altina, but you instead.

08:24.320 --> 08:26.900
Huh? What?

08:26.900 --> 08:30.400
Me, meddling with her?

08:30.400 --> 08:35.220
So you're against me, a fellow beastman,
getting close with him?!

08:35.220 --> 08:39.480
No! I never speak ill of you!

08:39.480 --> 08:41.110
I just...

08:41.460 --> 08:45.760
I just want you to do this
kind of stuff without hesitations!

08:49.960 --> 08:50.680
What?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.130
Are you... a pervert?

08:53.130 --> 08:56.680
N-No! You're getting the wrong idea, Miss Shea!

08:56.680 --> 09:00.110
I just want to be friends with you!

09:00.110 --> 09:01.670
You're looking for friends, right?

09:01.670 --> 09:03.550
Huh? Me?

09:04.220 --> 09:05.240
Um...

09:05.620 --> 09:08.910
We're close in terms of age,

09:08.910 --> 09:12.530
and um... in terms of social status,
we're both princesses of our own tribe,

09:12.530 --> 09:14.950
so, um...

09:15.290 --> 09:19.400
I never had a friend of equal status...

09:19.910 --> 09:25.320
I hate to admit it, but I don't know
how to be friends with one...

09:25.320 --> 09:30.110
Whenever you get close to Mister Hajime,
he'll always pat you in the head, so...

09:30.500 --> 09:34.040
Pat? But I'm not a dog...

09:34.300 --> 09:36.200
You could just ask him nicely...

09:36.200 --> 09:39.300
A dog... Treated like a dog...

09:39.300 --> 09:41.640
Huh? That's what gets you excited?

09:43.050 --> 09:47.980
So, will you answer
to my request earlier?

09:51.290 --> 09:53.320
When someone asks me to be her friend,

09:53.640 --> 09:55.620
there's no reason for me
to turn her down.

10:00.070 --> 10:04.120
Sweet! Please play "with" me
a lot from now on, then!

10:04.120 --> 10:04.710
Aww!

10:04.710 --> 10:07.550
I sense another meaning in that "with"!

10:07.550 --> 10:10.470
You're just a hopeless pervert!

10:17.200 --> 10:20.490
Hajime, what was that about?

10:21.310 --> 10:24.920
I had a hunch about this
since some time ago...

10:26.090 --> 10:28.400
So has Shea become
someone special to you?

10:28.400 --> 10:30.070
When? How?

10:30.360 --> 10:31.720
What happened?

10:32.600 --> 10:34.200
How do I put it...

10:34.970 --> 10:38.950
I realised a while ago that
I'm still not in the same league as Yue,

10:39.360 --> 10:42.410
but I'm still apparently
possessive about Shea.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.600
That's what I'm feeling.

10:45.610 --> 10:47.220
Yue also gave me some advice,

10:47.590 --> 10:51.010
so I decided to act appropriately to Shea.

10:51.470 --> 10:53.580
It's not like anything has happened.

10:53.950 --> 10:58.260
So that means you have
romantic feelings for Shea?

10:58.260 --> 11:00.230
To be honest, I don't really know.

11:00.700 --> 11:02.300
But I don't think that's the case.

11:03.010 --> 11:05.350
I do think she's irreplaceable to me.

11:11.620 --> 11:12.560
I see.

11:13.900 --> 11:14.870
Okay.

11:16.010 --> 11:17.070
Hajime.

11:17.070 --> 11:18.200
What?

11:20.710 --> 11:22.060
Better prepare yourself.

11:24.840 --> 11:25.940
For real...

11:26.690 --> 11:28.900
I don't deserve all the company.

11:32.090 --> 11:33.230
Yue.

11:33.750 --> 11:36.380
What did you just do? Huh?

11:36.380 --> 11:39.360
Shea's fine, but you, Kaori...

11:39.360 --> 11:40.550
Not you.

11:40.860 --> 11:42.510
Get lost already.

11:45.080 --> 11:46.730
You wanna fight, huh?!

11:46.730 --> 11:49.100
Yue, you idiot!
I'll knock that face out!

11:49.100 --> 11:51.430
- You little...!
- I'm not sure if they're close or not...

11:51.430 --> 11:54.030
- Idiot! Idiot!
- So, Master...

11:54.030 --> 11:57.480
Looks like you have successfully
made Shea fall for you.

11:57.480 --> 12:01.410
But what say you accept my love,
taller than the Divine Mountain,

12:01.410 --> 12:04.520
deeper than the Sunken Ruins?

12:04.930 --> 12:06.830
I can do with Kaori, but not you.

12:09.390 --> 12:11.980
Such strong words!

12:11.980 --> 12:14.590
My lovely Master!

12:14.590 --> 12:16.650
You really hit a spot there!

12:16.650 --> 12:20.320
Oh, this is too much!
You really are a licensed masseuse!

12:20.320 --> 12:22.550
Spot-on!

12:33.960 --> 12:35.020
Mister Hajime.

12:37.790 --> 12:38.740
Um...

12:39.060 --> 12:43.500
Well... About what you said earlier...

12:43.500 --> 12:44.280
Shea.

12:46.510 --> 12:48.400
It's exactly as you said.

12:49.810 --> 12:51.340
The future isn't absolute.

12:51.970 --> 12:53.960
And that's exactly right.

12:56.330 --> 12:59.470
I won't try to find out
about your feelings now.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.320
You’re irreplaceable to me.

13:02.020 --> 13:03.890
I don't want to hand
you over to anyone.

13:06.440 --> 13:07.870
Mister Hajime...

13:08.620 --> 13:11.350
I won’t ever let you go,
so I hope you’re ready.

13:12.080 --> 13:13.860
You're my special.

13:16.240 --> 13:17.040
Yes...

13:17.820 --> 13:22.360
Okay! I'm special to you!

13:32.610 --> 13:35.250
They're doing it outside?!

13:35.250 --> 13:37.860
Hey, pipe down, Suzu!

13:37.860 --> 13:40.300
You pipe down, Shizuku!

13:40.300 --> 13:42.920
All of you, shut up.
Don't bother them.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.820
Hey, idiot! Stop pushing!

13:48.720 --> 13:51.640
Everyone?!
Since when were you there?!

13:52.100 --> 13:53.190
Since the beginning.

13:54.320 --> 13:56.520
They saw it all...

13:56.520 --> 13:59.120
Why didn't you tell me?!

13:59.120 --> 14:01.540
It's not something we should
keep a secret, right?

14:01.540 --> 14:03.950
Well, that might be true...

14:03.950 --> 14:05.590
So, how was it?

14:05.590 --> 14:09.600
How did Master's passionate kiss feel?

14:09.600 --> 14:12.500
Come, tell me everything!

14:12.500 --> 14:14.230
Now that you are one step ahead,

14:14.230 --> 14:17.450
let me hear your happy plus
embarrassing experience!

14:17.450 --> 14:19.120
Come on now... How did y—

14:21.590 --> 14:23.830
Restrain yourself,
you useless dragon.

14:26.120 --> 14:27.050
Come here.

14:30.710 --> 14:33.980
Miss Yue!

14:34.640 --> 14:38.420
Miss Yue, I finally did it!

14:39.250 --> 14:42.030
Well done.

14:46.590 --> 14:49.320
I love you!

14:49.320 --> 14:52.540
We'll be together forever!

14:52.540 --> 14:55.960
Isn't she more emotional
with Yue than with me?

14:55.960 --> 14:58.950
Tio, we'll be up next.

14:58.950 --> 15:00.080
Let's do our best.

15:00.080 --> 15:01.820
That is right.

15:01.820 --> 15:06.900
I shall dream of the day Master
strikes me actively and do my best!

15:06.900 --> 15:08.730
You never change, do you?

15:09.520 --> 15:11.560
Don't tempt me so much, okay?

15:17.000 --> 15:20.650
So, why were you all peeping on us?

15:21.080 --> 15:23.570
It's still too early to call us for dinner.

15:24.310 --> 15:26.140
Got some business with me?

15:26.140 --> 15:28.520
Um, about that...

15:28.520 --> 15:30.890
We just happened to meet
with Yue and the others.

15:31.650 --> 15:33.090
As for we...

15:41.650 --> 15:43.840
Nagumo, you see...

15:43.840 --> 15:47.430
I was hoping you could take me
with you to the next Labyrinth.

15:47.760 --> 15:49.180
I beg you!

15:50.850 --> 15:52.440
Suzu, you...

15:52.440 --> 15:54.010
Koki, sorry.

15:54.010 --> 15:57.950
This is my own request,
so don't try to butt in.

15:59.480 --> 16:01.450
How come?

16:01.450 --> 16:04.750
I'll take you to Japan even if you don't
come with me to the Labyrinth.

16:04.750 --> 16:10.130
Even if you want to become stronger,
I'll just enhance the Artifacts, no problem.

16:10.130 --> 16:12.660
You're right.

16:12.660 --> 16:14.700
But, Nagumo...

16:16.190 --> 16:17.640
I guess...

16:18.190 --> 16:20.600
...you don't want to help Eri too, right?

16:21.370 --> 16:22.920
Nakamura, huh?

16:23.350 --> 16:24.560
Well, you're right.

16:25.080 --> 16:29.610
In fact, if she ever appears before me,
I might just kill her without hesitation.

16:30.000 --> 16:32.850
She's one of the people
who killed Kaori, after all.

16:32.850 --> 16:34.800
I guess so...

16:35.540 --> 16:39.130
But I want to meet her again
and talk to her.

16:39.540 --> 16:41.520
That's why I need more power.

16:42.040 --> 16:45.810
Which is the reason I want to
challenge the Great Labyrinth again.

16:45.810 --> 16:49.450
No matter the results,
if I can come back alive...

16:49.780 --> 16:52.520
I'll just go to the demons' nation right away.

16:53.370 --> 16:54.950
Suzu, that's...

16:58.110 --> 17:01.910
So, if I can bring Eri with me,

17:01.910 --> 17:04.960
I want you to send her to Japan as well.

17:05.410 --> 17:07.880
Please! I beg you!

17:13.490 --> 17:15.850
Nagumo, I beg you as well.

17:16.220 --> 17:18.040
Eri is after me.

17:18.040 --> 17:22.200
I too... No, I shall be the one
who must set things straight with her.

17:23.690 --> 17:27.170
Besides, I can't just let
Suzu go to Garland alone.

17:28.750 --> 17:29.810
Also...

17:31.650 --> 17:33.270
I can't let it end like this!

17:34.030 --> 17:36.700
Even Shizuku could obtain ancient magic...

17:36.700 --> 17:37.690
So I...

17:38.860 --> 17:41.790
I will gain more power this time!

17:41.790 --> 17:42.840
Koki...

17:43.640 --> 17:47.630
Well, we can't just send Suzu there alone.

17:48.040 --> 17:51.420
I won't be satisfied until
I get to hit Eri in the face.

17:51.970 --> 17:54.550
Sorry, but I'm asking
you a favour, Nagumo.

17:54.550 --> 17:55.640
Please!

17:56.720 --> 17:57.700
Nagumo.

17:58.190 --> 17:59.130
Um...

18:00.010 --> 18:01.480
Would you do this?

18:12.970 --> 18:16.490
If Nakamura turns hostile
even just for a bit,

18:17.140 --> 18:19.150
I'll finish her off right away, okay?

18:20.450 --> 18:23.190
Nagumo! Thank you!

18:25.240 --> 18:27.880
Should I pull myself together
when I become soft...

18:28.510 --> 18:31.860
...or should I think of it
as a leeway in my heart?

18:32.290 --> 18:33.820
This is difficult.

18:34.180 --> 18:36.800
It can be either way.

18:37.240 --> 18:40.220
There's no mistaking
that you've become stronger.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.620
I will protect you,

18:42.620 --> 18:44.640
and you will protect me.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.630
That's what makes us the strongest.

18:47.100 --> 18:48.070
Right?

18:49.990 --> 18:54.240
Add me to the mix,
and we're invincible!

18:54.240 --> 18:59.240
After all, I'm feeling invincible
now after you've accepted me!

18:59.640 --> 19:02.050
I'll protect you too!

19:02.050 --> 19:06.120
Don't worry! I'll disassemble
anything that comes to us!

19:06.120 --> 19:09.760
Fret not, all of you.

19:09.760 --> 19:13.240
I, the jet black dragon,
shall protect you all.

19:14.330 --> 19:17.220
We truly are invincible,
just like Shea said.

19:20.540 --> 19:25.060
When we're done clearing the Labyrinth,
we gotta pick Myu up...

19:26.170 --> 19:27.170
Man...

19:27.540 --> 19:31.530
Our journey is almost over,
but there's more things to contemplate now.

19:35.470 --> 19:39.620
A group of Kingdom soldiers' corpses
and beastmen...

19:41.110 --> 19:44.960
Chimera soldiers with strength
greater than humans or demons,

19:45.400 --> 19:48.540
able to use even magic...

19:48.540 --> 19:50.230
How pitiful.

19:50.880 --> 19:53.980
Oh? What's up, Freid?

19:54.300 --> 19:56.720
Came to see my work?

19:57.680 --> 20:01.010
Eri, do not interfere with my perceptions.

20:01.010 --> 20:02.990
Do you want to be suspected of treason?

20:03.320 --> 20:06.210
Come on, don't get so worked up.

20:06.520 --> 20:09.240
I'm just a feeble girl, mind you.

20:12.070 --> 20:15.740
You like my corpse and beast soldiers?

20:16.130 --> 20:18.620
They are useful as a military force.

20:18.620 --> 20:20.910
Come on, don't look so gloomy.

20:21.240 --> 20:23.670
You lent me a hand,

20:23.670 --> 20:26.080
hence they could grow this beautifully.

20:27.420 --> 20:31.680
By the way, the kids were swarming,

20:31.680 --> 20:34.090
but I didn't see any of them this morning.

20:34.090 --> 20:36.510
I had them welcome our guests.

20:36.970 --> 20:39.720
Other than our main guests, for now.

20:39.720 --> 20:41.430
Oh, I see!

20:41.430 --> 20:46.350
So that means a fun,
fun party is about to begin now.

20:47.520 --> 20:50.670
I can't wait for the day
I see them again.

21:11.780 --> 21:14.250
What's that?

21:16.350 --> 21:18.330
It's finally begun...

21:20.370 --> 21:22.660
My long journey...

21:23.260 --> 21:25.160
...is almost over now.

21:25.680 --> 21:29.880
Myu! It's lunchtime!

21:36.270 --> 21:38.890
Mama, what's for lunch!

21:38.890 --> 21:40.760
Your favourite menu.

21:40.760 --> 21:41.800
Really?

21:42.320 --> 21:43.920
Hey, what's that?

21:49.930 --> 21:52.580
Is there someone in the sky?

23:33.020 --> 23:34.980
THE FINAL LABYRINTH

23:34.980 --> 23:37.920
THE FINAL LABYRINTH
Next episode: The Final Labyrinth.

23:37.920 --> 23:40.880
THE FINAL LABYRINTH
